{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2023-08", "window": 2, "start_date": 1691452800, "end_date": 1692143999, "month_true_total": 83, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:53:51 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "144296376", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079368168", "personaname": "Dragon_Fodder", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198079368168/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 53, "playtime_forever": 1082, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 780, "last_played": 1718937381, "avatar": "b2edbc430cffa963966ebafc9e7844414a9c51c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best 3rd person arcade shooters of all time. I'd avoid the itemized purchases though. They aren't going to be relevant for long enough to be worth it. A good experience solo and with friends as the entire feeling of the game changes with additional boots on the field. Get it on sale if possible and drag your friends into this crazy shooter with you.", "timestamp_created": 1692140920, "timestamp_updated": 1692140920, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "144288588", "author": {"steamid": "76561198307666077", "personaname": "DarkBooger", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198307666077/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 5276, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4964, "last_played": 1781765977, "avatar": "3f9ce7c86d315d326385ea05f1378a1525107e3d"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm gonna keep it short and simple with a list of Pros and Cons:\n\nPros:\n-Tutorial is short and simple, my drill sergeant teaches me how to shoot straight only to get mauled by a giant ant afterwards before getting thrown right into the thick of it\n-Just keep shooting until you get back to base for a good meal that you will probably have to cook yourself\n-Potentially hundreds of hours worth of content if you want to 100% this game on all characters and difficulties.\n\nCons:\n-Humor from some of the NPCs in this game may not be to your liking", "timestamp_created": 1692131877, "timestamp_updated": 1725842115, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "144248332", "author": {"steamid": "76561198346606028", "personaname": "The Bimman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198346606028/", "num_games_owned": 194, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 2533, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1843, "last_played": 1692988991, "avatar": "455008747c628cc1bc41b5ef0add4635af8f4b0a"}, "language": "english", "review": "game sucks but its fun\n\nalso the voice acting. soo this game is trying to be cheesy right? i sure hope so because if it isnt they failed horribly", "timestamp_created": 1692094265, "timestamp_updated": 1692094265, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47826087474822998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "144234286", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072302666", "personaname": "Listee_Extraordinaire", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198072302666/", "num_games